  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375 F (190 C).",
    "In a bowl, whisk tamarind paste with 2 tbsp water, honey, and olive oil until smooth.",
    "Pat sausage dry and place in a baking dish, drizzle with half of the tamarind glaze.",
    "Arrange sliced peppers, onion, and tomato around sausage; sprinkle with cumin, paprika, and oregano.",
    "Pour vegetable broth into dish, cover with foil.",
    "Roast for 45 minutes, then remove foil, brush remaining glaze over sausage, and continue roasting for another 15 minutes until caramelized.",
    "Let the roast rest 10 minutes before slicing.",
    "Serve slices with a side of sautéed greens or quinoa to keep the meal balanced."
  ],
